</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8376701e-890a-11f1-902e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26207532498097.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8376701e-890a-11f1-902e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26207532498097.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e4775dc6-891c-11f1-9eaf-eb45b528652e</guid><pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 18:07:40 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/8376701e-890a-11f1-902e-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26207532498097.jpg">AP Photo/Ebrahim Noroozi - Ebrahim Noroozi</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>欧洲南部正在燃烧，尤其是法国和西班牙......</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260724-%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E5%8D%97%E9%83%A8%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E7%87%83%E7%83%A7%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%A4%E5%85%B6%E6%98%AF%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E5%92%8C%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99</link><description>
